 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Good to hear from you. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_06",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not bad at all, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, honest question. Are gift cards lazy?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not if they're thoughtful. A card for someone's favourite bookshop says you know them.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And a generic one?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A generic card can feel a bit impersonal, but most people still use and appreciate them.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My cousin is really",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.13,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "hard to shop for.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.81,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a gift card is a good choice. Add a short note about something you'd love them to treat themselves to.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Like what?",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Something like, for that fancy dinner you keep talking about. It makes it feel planned, not last minute.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
